{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_07",
  "title": "背叛",
  "storyCode": "MB-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fa4dbdeea41933f2f3023ac0c7a5eb9fff7933797d4a87fe67c3dba209f8a8d8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "啊，这下终于到实行越狱的环节了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "感觉整个流程虽然略过了一些事情，但还是比我想象的要复杂许多呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "呼啊，我都有些困了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅尔",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "我也有一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅尔",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "啊，我去给大家泡一杯咖啡吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "还差一点就结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "我知道我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "不过接下来发生的事我也差不多猜到啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "一切准备就绪，只等实行越狱的那一天到来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "但是在实行的那一天，有一个人却忽然失踪了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "他们最终决定在监狱停靠在纽莱堡市期间的某一次进入C区清扫的机会进行越狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "但是在那一天约定的时间，罗宾却没有出现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "因为他们不知道，他们的计划早已被在暗处的杰斯顿完全掌握了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "而罗宾，早已经在他们的必经之路上等待着他们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "虽然场面有点混乱，但是姑且跟你确认一下我们的计划！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "我们像现在这样，趁打扫囚房的机会进来配合你放倒囚犯和狱警......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "然后我们两个趁着监控那边的狱警还没来得及反应，直接前往顶层启动塔的下沉，然后让监狱断电。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "杜玛已经在地下等着了，只要和她汇合，然后一起进入早就挖好的地道里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "最后换上米娜帮我们偷来的工作人员的服装出去就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "我一直很怀疑，真的有适合我体格的工作人员服装吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "放心放心，杜玛特意帮你重新缝制过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "一件不够那就用两件拼起来嘛，看起来超大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "记得感谢她哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "再！见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "你似乎很兴奋，卡夫卡小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "嘿嘿，越狱这么好玩的事情，我当然要兴奋了!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "对了，怎么没看到罗宾小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "text": "这次清扫的都是老面孔，就不用我多说了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "是~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_132",
      "text": "长官，要是我们之中又有要刺杀安东尼老大的怎么办啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "text": "你傻的啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "text": "你以为刚才的搜身是干嘛的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "text": "我就不信你们空着手能干得过安东尼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我看你很想和安东尼先生过过招啊，要打的话喊我一声，我来给你助助威。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_132",
      "text": "滚，没跟你说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "（怎么回事，罗宾怎么没来？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "喂，A区的大哥，罗宾人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_132",
      "text": "B区的别跟我说话......哦，是卡夫卡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_132",
      "text": "不知道啊，刚才就没找到她，我就是顶替她来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "text": "行了，少废话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狱警B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_134",
      "text": "A区的跟他，B区的跟我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "啧，没有时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "罗宾，抱歉了啊，要怪只能怪你自己这么紧要的关头不在了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......事到如今，也没有回头的路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "以后还能遇到她的话再向她道歉吧，走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "这里就是主控室了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "呜哇，灰尘好多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "当心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "诶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "罗宾？！为什么你会在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "我有备份的卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "char_214_kafka",
      "text": "备份？你什么时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗宾",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "B区囚犯B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_133",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "退后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "......我们赶时间，现在没有说话的时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "text": "速战速决吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
